  "description": "A cozy window seat high above a rainy cyberpunk city. Neon signs flicker, flying cars drift between the towers, rain streaks down the glass and a black cat naps next to a steaming mug. Move the mouse to wipe the fogged-up window, click the glass for raindrops, click the cat to wake it. The billboard, radio and fairy lights dance to your music. Four color moods, thunderstorms, a neon clock and more in the settings. Light on the GPU (Canvas 2D).",
